OL,3,GNEWSABattle of bands brings islands'   
OL,4,Arivalry to stage                       
OL,6,FThe winning bands will receive a       
OL,7,Fprofessional studio recording and video
OL,8,Fsession at their home island's School  
OL,9,Fof Popular Music studio.               
